				<section class="mb-10">
					<h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-semibold">
						16. Summary of Key Points
					</h2>
					<p class="mb-4">
						To help you understand our privacy practices, here is a
						concise summary:
					</p>
					<ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-8">
						<li>
							<strong>We collect</strong> your email, account data,
							and usage metrics to provide and improve the Service
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>We do not sell</strong> your personal data to
